        "username": "HikariStarshine",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/h/87869e/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-02-23T18:03:51.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So, ran into a situation that aborted this scenario right away because we weren't sure how to parse it all out.</p><p>Proletariat's 'The Everyman' innate power says that all Proletariats share one set of actions, defense, <strong>movement</strong>, and health.</p><p>Oblivion Shards grant a passive <strong>Move value -2</strong>, and grant an Attack+1 and a Defense-1 token every Surge phase.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So... &nbsp;Question 1: If Proletariats #1 and #2 are holding Oblivion Shards, is the movement value of Proletariats #1, #2, and #3 all at -4, or is it -2 each for #1 and #2, and #3 is unaffected?</p><p>Question 2: If Proletariats #1 and #2 are holding Oblivion Shards, does Proletariat collect one Attack+1 and Defense-1 at the Surge phase, or does Proletariat collect two of each?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:43:57.688Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 1,
