        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>So, ran into a situation that aborted this scenario right away because we weren&#39;t sure how to parse it all out.</p><p>Proletariat&#39;s &#39;The Everyman&#39; innate power says that all Proletariats share one set of actions, defense, <strong>movement</strong>, and health.</p><p>Oblivion Shards grant a passive <strong>Move value -2</strong>, and grant an Attack+1 and a Defense-1 token every Surge phase.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So... &nbsp;Question 1: If Proletariats #1 and #2 are holding Oblivion Shards, is the movement value of Proletariats #1, #2, and #3 all at -4, or is it -2 each for #1 and #2, and #3 is unaffected?</p><p>Question 2: If Proletariats #1 and #2 are holding Oblivion Shards, does Proletariat collect one Attack+1 and Defense-1 at the Surge phase, or does Proletariat collect two of each?</p>",
