        "created_at": "2015-02-23T21:55:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Shards affect the Character, and Proletarial is one character, so each of his clones is treated as if they are at -4 move and Proletariat would gain 2 of each token.</p><p>He is one character carrying 2 shards.</p>",
